hpp.artifacts.diplomaticArtifacts.shackl:
{Shackles of War}

This artifact prevents heroes from retreating or surrendering.

{Exception:} A hero with Expert Diplomacy or Diplomat's Cloak neutralizes this artifact's effect in battles where retreat or surrender is normally available.

hpp.artifacts.diplomaticArtifacts.diplom:
{Diplomacy - expert level}

Allows negotiations with neutral creatures so they may join the hero's army and reduces surrender cost by {50%}.

It also allows the hero to retreat or surrender despite {Shackles of War}, as long as that battle normally allows retreat or surrender.

